select '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',null,'Workshop Tools Check',$d$Weekly check of the workshop tools so nothing is missing or unsafe: tool board, hand and power tools, torque wrench calibration, jacks and axle stands, air tools, tyre tools, diagnostic scanner, lifting gear and welding set. Any missing or damaged tool must be listed with a photo. Signed off by a supervisor, closed by the area manager.$d$,'Inspection','wrench','draft',1,true,true,
